  "checks": [
    "The fixed degree n+1 and width positiveReferenceTaylorWidth(n,l,r,U^-1,U) depend only on the original finite data envelope U and geometry. The later order N never changes that width, the scalar Taylor representatives or the actual coordinate/height.",
